  "body": "If I'm reading the spec correctly, we return an error if the body is a stream (it has no source) and we get a redirect that isn't 303 https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-http-redirect-fetch (step 9).\r\n\r\nIt seems like we could allow 301/2 redirects if the method is POST, since the body is discarded (step 11).",
